<li id="mwBFo"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Max_Planck_Research_Unit_for_Enzymology_of_Protein_Folding" title="Max Planck Research Unit for Enzymology of Protein Folding" id="mwBFs">Max Planck Research Unit for Enzymology of Protein Folding</a></li>
